51", "onchainId": "43136438228420234127439242165728406855560943995597370153579727537282848124169", "status": "executed", "quorum": null, "createdAt": "2022-03-04T16:35:04.155492Z", "chainId": "eip155:1", "governor": {"id": "eip155:1:0xBEC3de5b14902C660Bd2C7EfD2F259998424cc24"}, "start": {"number": 14186082, "timestamp": "2022-03-21T15:07:47Z"}, "end": {"number": 14231900, "timestamp": "2022-03-27T23:51:23Z"}, "voteStats": [{"type": "for", "votesCount": "73750380478102886421275", "votersCount": 5, "percent": 100}, {"type": "against", "votesCount": "0", "votersCount": 0, "percent": 0}, {"type": "abstain", "votesCount": "0", "votersCount": 0, "percent": 0}, {"type": "pendingfor", "votesCount": "0", "votersCount": 0, "percent": 0}, {"type": "pendingagainst", "votesCount": "0", "votersCount": 0, "percent": 0}, {"type": "pendingabstain", "votesCount": "0", "votersCount": 0, "percent": 0}], "events": [{"type": "created", "createdAt": "2022-02-11T17:22:11Z"}, {"type": "queued", "createdAt": "2022-02-18T19:33:06Z"}, {"type": "executed", "createdAt": "2022-02-21T17:53:21Z"}], "metadata": {"title": "# BIP-11: Heart Bonding Program", "description": "# BIP-11: Heart Bonding Program\nThe [previous BIP](<https://docs.google.com/document/d/1AYA7mjeOnYO6ODy2rD5HqAC75R1aa_QGFBh4Js9dvng/edit#>) introduced and approved the heart. This BIP aims to implement the bonding program so BABL holders can deposit wanted assets and receive staked BABL (hBABL) as a discount.\n\n<br>\n\nInitially, users can deposit cTokens from the Babylon Fuse Pool and uniswap BABL-ETH LP tokens and will receive a 3% and 5% discount respectively.\n\n<br>\n\nAdditionally, the treasury will allocate 10k BABL to lend in the Fuse pool and use borrowings to purchase BABL from Babylon strategies offering a 1% premium from market price.<br>\n\n<br>\n\nYou can read all the information here:<br>\n\n[https://docs.google.com/document/d/1f71Xcq67o4xw5oa4Lsh6uYsOTHInmUC-XZUreQKUdhU/edit](<https://docs.google.com/document/d/1f71Xcq67o4xw5oa4Lsh6uYsOTHInmUC-XZUreQKUdhU/edit>)\n\n"}}, {"id": "1746485560559535290", "onchainId": "78817265558555979358372190833964450694070165926941922942875808883601373432428", "status": "executed", "quorum": null, "createdAt": "2022-03-04T16:35:02.885986Z", "chainId": "eip155:1", "governor": {"id": "eip155:1:0xBEC3de5b14902C660Bd2C7EfD2F259998424cc24"}, "start": {"number": 14096916, "timestamp": "2022-03-09T05:54:35Z"}, "end": {"number": 14142734, "timestamp": "2022-03-15T14:38:11Z"}, "voteStats": [{"type": "for", "votesCount": "49084379903066990569668", "votersCount": 5, "percent": 100}, {"type": "against", "votesCount": "0", "votersCount": 0, "percent": 0}, {"type": "abstain", "votesCount": "0", "votersCount": 0, "percent": 0}, {"type": "pendingfor", "votesCount": "0", "votersCount": 0, "percent": 0}, {"type": "pendingagainst", "votesCount": "0", "votersCount": 0, "percent": 0}, {"type": "pendingabstain", "votesCount": "0", "votersCount": 0, "percent": 0}], "events": [{"type": "created", "createdAt": "2022-01-28T22:37:34Z"}, {"type": "queued", "createdAt": "2022-02-05T00:37:03Z"}, {"type": "executed", "createdAt": "2022-02-06T21:27:46Z"}], "metadata": {"title": "# BIP-10: Heart Tokenomics", "description": "# BIP-10: Heart Tokenomics\nBabylon Finance is introducing a 💪 **staking mechanic for BABL holders**.<br>\n\nFirst of all, we are using our **own Garden technology to 🐶 dogfood and create this mechanic**. As you may know, Babylon Finance lets people create and invest together through investment DAOs that we call 🌴 Gardens. Garden members create DeFi strategies and invest in DeFi together, sharing the gas costs and the returns.<br>\n\n🫀**The Heart of Babylon** is a **garden** that will receive BABL as deposits and will give depositors hBABL. The heart will receive capital from fees and BABL from stakers and infuse them both with renewed energy.<br>\n\n💪 🌴 hBABL is a super garden token that includes **10 + 1 different mechanics** inspired by the very best of DeFi and synthesized together to provide value to BABL holders and Babylon users alike.<br>\n\n<br>\n\nFull info here<br>\n\n[https://docs.google.com/document/d/1AYA7mjeOnYO6ODy2rD5HqAC75R1aa\\_QGFBh4Js9dvng/edit#](<https://docs.google.com/document/d/1AYA7mjeOnYO6ODy2rD5HqAC75R1aa_QGFBh4Js9dvng/edit#>)\n\n"}}, {"id": "1746480135067927576", "onchainId": "96926906852583318420120210736156562250032829980249658428548490379878799127253", "status": "executed", "quorum": null, "createdAt": "2022-03-04T16:24:16.116833Z", "chainId": "eip155:1", "governor": {"id": "eip155:1:0xBEC3de5b14902C660Bd2C7EfD2F259998424cc24"}, "start": {"number": 14029030, "timestamp": "2022-02-27T19:37:23Z"}, "end": {"number": 14074848, "timestamp": "2022-03-06T04:20:59Z"}, "voteStats": [{"type": "for", "votesCount": "64018288722862739000862", "votersCount": 3, "percent": 100}, {"type": "against", "votesCount": "0", "votersCount": 0, "percent": 0}, {"type": "abstain", "votesCount": "0", "votersCount": 0, "percent": 0}, {"type": "pendingfor", "votesCount": "0", "votersCount": 0, "percent": 0}, {"type": "pendingagainst", "votesCount": "0", "votersCount": 0, "percent": 0}, {"type": "pendingabstain", "votesCount": "0", "votersCount": 0, "percent": 0}], "events": [{"type": "created", "createdAt": "2022-01-18T10:45:46Z"}, {"type": "queued", "createdAt": "2022-01-25T17:17:27Z"}, {"type": "executed", "createdAt": "2022-01-26T18:40:04Z"}], "metadata": {"title": "BIP-9: Development Fund", "description": "BIP-9: Development Fund"}}, {"id": "1746480056751883283", "onchainId": "42309909082201573650128991948203453910830611292212115544850475689408371624584", "status": "queued", "quorum": null, "createdAt": "2022-03-04T16:24:06.780244Z", "chainId": "eip155:1", "governor": {"id": "eip155:1:0xBEC3de5b14902C660Bd2C7EfD2F259998424cc24"}, "start": {"number": 13935111, "timestamp": "2022-02-14T18:33:35Z"}, "end": {"number": 13980929, "timestamp": "2022-02-21T03:17:11Z"}, "voteStats": [{"type": "for", "votesCount": "490132